description:
Plan item T-C (local://brief-size-remediation-plan.md §2 e and f, §4.1), folded into the planned legacy-cleanup release:
- (e) pick the brief mode from the rendered size (split _assemble_prompt into compose and render);
- (f) send the brief to omp on stdin, add a candidate-check canary for omp bumps, and restate the inline bound in terms of capacity;
- recalibrate capacity from schema-2 captures;
- delete legacy.py and all old-name reads and mirroring, once no open BenchBox PR carries old markers.
This is the first self-gated Theseus PR, reviewed by theseus-review[bot] under the 0.2.0 rules.
